{%- comment -%}
  Canonical built-in colour-name → hex fallback map.

  Single source of truth shared by every colour filter UI:
  - blocks/filters.liquid (sidebar + colour bar)
  - snippets/list-filter.liquid (facet rendering)
  - blocks/color-facets.liquid (quick filter row)
  - sections/collection-filters.liquid (parallel collection page)

  Output: one comma-separated "name:#hex" string. Edit colours HERE only.
  Merchant-configured maps (color_group_map / custom_map) always win over this.
{%- endcomment -%}
